## Approach

Port `swi_moshplan2` as a pure function with no global state. The algorithm walks the planet's `arg_tbl` byte stream, consuming coefficients from `lon_tbl`/`lat_tbl`/`rad_tbl` in lockstep, accumulating trigonometric series in arcseconds, then converting to radians/AU. The sin/cos harmonic lookup tables (`sscc`) become a local `[[f64; 24]; 9]` array pair instead of C's TLS globals.

